Name: Google Style Guides 2026 (Chromium C++, Rust 2024, TypeScript, Go, Python, Shell, AOSP)
Short Name: styleguide
URL: https://github.com/google/styleguide
License: CC-BY-3.0 / Apache-2.0
License File: LICENSE
Version: 2026.1.0
Revision: HEAD
Security Critical: yes
Shipped: yes
Forks:
  - https://github.com/aphrody-labs/styleguide
  - https://github.com/yolo-rs/styleguide

Description:
Official Google and Chromium style guides covering TypeScript 5.8+/7.0, Rust 2024 (Unsafe & FFI Policy),
Chromium C++20/23, Go 1.24+, Python 3.13+, Shell, and AOSP Android 17 (API 36).

Local Modifications:
- Fused with yolo-standards schemas (google-styleguide-2026.current.json).
- Exposed as a native Bun bundler & runtime plugin via yolo-bun:google-styleguide.
